---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Done here: the conversations leave one mode until someone writes again (in To do, their open to-dos are ticked off). When no other mode holds a conversation it is archived at your provider too, unless `modes.archive_on_last_done` is off. Prints what happened and an undo id for `mxr undo`

Usage: mxr modes done [OPTIONS] --mode <MODE> <THREAD_IDS>...

Arguments:
  <THREAD_IDS>...  Thread ids, as `mxr now --format ids` prints them

Options:
      --mode <MODE>      The mode to be done in: messages, todo, updates or reading
      --dry-run          Show what done would change without changing anything
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
